	"Name": "(AT) NPC Furniture and wallpaper",
	"Author": "Asterisk555",
	"TagLine": "Adds furniture, walls, and floors from NPC houses as alternative textures",
	"Description": "_Description_\n\n*   Adds furniture from NPC houses as alternative textures for your furniture and walls and floors\n\n*   There's witchy furniture, game room furniture, various electronics, bathroom furniture, and many others.\n_Quick start_\n\n1.  Download and extract this mod and it's requirements into your mods folder (if you are confused check out [this guide](https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Modding:Player_Guide/Getting_Started#Getting_started) ).\n\n2.  It's ready to play. Buy the paint bucket at Robin's shop to retexture items. There is a [video](https://youtu.be/OzCzEppsXVY)  on how to use the mod in-game.\n_Compatibility_\n\n*   Alternative Textures (AT) version works with lots of other mods\n_Mods that go well with this one_\n\n*   [Adorable Cottage Bathroom](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/10982)\n\n*   [Painting Displays](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/12372)\n\n*   [Beam Mod](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/11597)\n\n*   [Cozy Kitchen](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/10473)\n\n*   [Chests as baskets](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/12219)",
